Package: rustmailstack
Version: @VERSION@
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: vahid.im <vaha@vahid.im>
Homepage: https://github.com/fvaha/RustMailStack
Depends: curl, openssl, ca-certificates, python3
Recommends: caddy
Description: Stalwart + IRIS self-hosted mail stack
 Stalwart mail server with the IRIS webmail frontend, packaged as one unit:
 systemd services, Caddy vhosts, TLS certificate sync and a health check.
 .
 Includes both mail server and webmail; no Docker, no compiler on the target
 host. White-label: name, logo, colours and links come from
 /etc/iris/branding.json.
